<title>UK: BZW appoints new oil &amp; gas corporate finance head.</title>
<headline>BZW appoints new oil &amp; gas corporate finance head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW on Monday announced it appointed John Pearson as a managing director in its coprorate finance division to head a team focusing on the global energy sector.</p>
<p>Pearson, 50, used to work for Schroders where he headed the energy team in the past 10 years.</p>
<p>&quot;There are very few professionals in London who can match John's experience and achievement in the energy sector,&quot; said Richard Gillingwater, joint head of BZW corporate finance.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
